flowchart TD
  start([New requirement]) --> clear{Requirements clear?}
  clear -- no --> ask[Ask clarifying questions] --> clear
  clear -- yes --> options[List 2–3 options]
  options --> score[Score with weighted criteria]
  score --> pick{Clear winner?}
  pick -- yes --> adr[Write ADR] --> poc[Build smallest PoC]
  pick -- no --> spike[Time-boxed spike on top 2] --> score
  poc --> done([Demo + explain trade-offs])
